Description:
 linuxmuster-api7 - Api for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-api7 (7.4.17) lmn74; urgency=high
 .
   * [security] Teachers could add users to any AD group through the
     management groups routes: only management groups are accepted.
   * [security] Root command execution through the target directory of
     POST /exammode/stop.
   * [security] /query is limited to the own school, except for global
     administrators, and never returns first passwords.
   * [security] Parents and staff have the same rank as teachers. A user
     can't act on another user of the same rank or of another school.
   * [security] First passwords of other users are hidden from teachers
     (except students) and from school administrators (administrators).
   * [security] School administrators only see the administrators and
     bind users of their own school.
   * [security] [sessions] The members of a new session and the owner of
     a session are checked.
   * [vdi] VDI groups return a display name and the OS family, the
     connection returns the VM assigned by the broker.
   * [samba] smbstatus is read through linuxmuster-tools.
   * Depends on linuxmuster-tools7 (>= 7.4.21).
